WEBVTT

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.290
with parental support, 
they can succeed.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.570
(Applause)

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:06.020
SRK: Please tell me, 
this is a personal question.

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:09.270
I have been reading a lot over the years,
does Mars have water on it?

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.080
They keep saying
it’s there, not there.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.480
So just quietly let me know.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:15.310
RK: I can’t claim anything.

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:17.560
Only a space physicist 
will be able to tell you

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:19.760
but yes, there is a lot of data

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:21.060
that is being studied,

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.770
and there may be possibility 
of water being found there.

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:26.470
SRK: I was worried that
what if I reach there for a song

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:29.401
and don’t find water,
which would become a big problem then.

00:09:29.751 --> 00:09:30.721
Thank you very much.